sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Player
    participant Client
    participant WS as WebSocket Gateway
    participant Room as Jury Room Service
    participant Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Player->>Client: Participates in jury room
    Client->>WS: Active WebSocket connection

    Note over Client,WS: Network connection is interrupted

    WS->>Room: Player disconnected
    Room->>Redis: Mark player temporarily disconnected
    Room->>Redis: Store current phase and remaining time
    Room->>Notify: Schedule reconnect notification
    Notify-->>Player: Rejoin active jury room

    alt Player reconnects within grace period
        Client->>WS: Reconnect with room token
        WS->>Room: Validate player membership
        Room->>Redis: Read active room state
        Redis-->>Room: Current case phase and timer
        Room->>Redis: Mark player connected
        Room-->>WS: Restore room state
        WS-->>Client: Resume active session
    else Player does not reconnect
        Room->>Redis: Mark player inactive

        alt Disconnection occurred before discussion
            Room->>Room: Find replacement player
        else Disconnection occurred during or after discussion
            Room->>DB: Record player as absent
            Room->>Room: Continue with remaining jurors
        end
    end